<title>RUSSIA: Rouble firms to 3,629 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble firms to 3,629 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,629 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,636 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 31		  Oct 30</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,629		   3,636</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.27		    1.30</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
